Cloud Hypervisor fork

This distribution is a fork of Cloud Hypervisor. The upstream project does
not accept changes to block devices that add non-local disk backends such
as NBD and iSCSI. This fork carries that work so other projects can use it.
NBD is the backend implemented here.

Upstream: https://github.com/cloud-hypervisor/cloud-hypervisor

